#: includes/core/strength-models.php:35
msgid ""
"Built-in model: how prominently the term name appears in the post title, "
"excerpt, and body."
msgstr ""
"Встроенная модель: насколько заметно название термина присутствует в "
"заголовке, отрывке и тексте записи."

#: includes/core/strength-models.php:318
msgid ""
"The built-in strength model is maintained by HyperTaxonomy and cannot be set "
